// A prefab: a piece of a place, drawn as rows of glyphs, and what each glyph
// stands for; see `treasure_room.ron` for the full field list.
//
// Lift the prize and the way you came falls in: two `Entry` cells, one at
// each end of the gallery, so growth may join it between two different
// areas. 'W' and 'X' are `Mark`s just inside each entry, and 'P' the
// prize's own; `src/vaults.rs`'s own `spawn_collapsing_gallery_trigger`
// and `collapse_gallery_behind` wall over whichever of 'W'/'X' is farther
// from whoever took the prize, the one they came in by.
(
    name: "The Collapsing Gallery",
    ground: "hall floor",
    rows: [
        "#########",
        "EW..P..XE",
        "#########",
    ],
    legend: {
        '#': Tile("hall wall"),
        '.': Tile("hall floor"),
        'W': Mark,
        'X': Mark,
        'P': Mark,
        'E': Entry,
    },
)
